# ── Live data API keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All optional. With none set, the site still works: World Bank (growth, inflation,
# per-capita, unemployment, current account, fiscal balance, debt, trade, FDI, market
# cap, broad money) and ECB/Frankfurter FX update live for free with NO key. Anything
# else falls back to clearly-labelled sample data.

# FRED — policy rates, 10-year government-bond yields, US unemployment, plus the
# monthly history behind the policy-rate and 10y-yield trend lines (sample without it).
# Free key: https://fredaccount.stlouisfed.org/apikeys
FRED_API_KEY=

# Finnhub — powers Market Pulse (28 major stocks + top riser), Story of the Day news,
# and daily index moves. Without it those show an honest "feed offline" state.
# Free key: https://finnhub.io/dashboard
FINNHUB_API_KEY=

# Alpha Vantage — backup for world stock markets (country ETFs) that Finnhub doesn't return.
# Free key: https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key (25 requests/day; cached daily here).
ALPHA_API_KEY=

# Optional: protect the daily cron endpoint (/api/refresh). If set, Vercel Cron sends
# it automatically as a Bearer token. Any random string works.
CRON_SECRET=
